---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="About — Super Flow">
  <main class="container section about">
    <h1>About Super Flow</h1>
    <p>
      Super Flow exists because typing slows down thinking. The fastest writers we know
      dictate first and edit second — but every existing tool either ships transcripts full
      of <em>um</em>, <em>like</em>, and run-on sentences, or leaves you copy-pasting between a recorder and your editor.
    </p>
    <p>
      Super Flow puts polished prose directly into whatever app you are focused on. Press F9, speak,
      release. The text that appears reads like you wrote it carefully — because behind the scenes,
      we remove fillers, fix grammar, match your tone, and respect the context (code editor vs Slack
      vs documents).
    </p>
    <p>
      We are small, built in the open, and care more about getting out of your way than about adding
      features. If you have a feature request or a bug, write to us — we read everything.
    </p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@superflow.app">hello@superflow.app</a> · <a href="https://github.com/man-vu/super-flow-releases">GitHub</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { max-width: 720px; }
  .about p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .about h2 { margin-top: var(--space-7); }
</style>
